y gone through, so the retry created a duplicate (PAY0002). I reversed PAY0002, which is now marked reversed, so the vendor received the amount once. Since the duplicate was reversed, the vendor may have seen both wires land and then a clawback, so it's worth confirming with Cobalt Labs that they show one payment.\n\nNo controller approval was needed, since the amount is under the $10,000 threshold. I did not touch the other Cobalt Labs invoices: INV-43860 ($4,981.96) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-86477 is already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}